---
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Helvetica
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Health Monitoring (externo)
    participant A as ALERT
    participant D as Dispatch Strategy Selector
    participant S as Ack Timeout Scheduler
    participant G as Caregiver
    participant I as INCIDENT

    H--)A: VitalSignAnomalyDetected (ACL)
    Note over A: policy: Biometric Alert Raiser
    A->>A: Trigger Alert (VITAL_SIGN_ANOMALY)
    A-->>A: Alert Triggered
    A-->>A: Alert Confirmed
    A->>D: severity = HIGH
    D->>A: Dispatch Alert
    A-->>A: Alert Dispatched (PRIMARY)
    alt el contacto primario responde a tiempo
        G->>A: Acknowledge Alert
        A-->>A: Alert Acknowledged
        A->>I: Open Incident
        I-->>I: Incident Opened (IN_ATTENTION)
    else vence el Ack Timeout (60 s)
        Note over S: policy: Ack Timeout Escalation
        S->>A: Escalate Alert
        A-->>A: Alert Escalated (SECONDARY)
        opt vence nuevamente sin reconocimiento
            Note over S: policy: Critical Broadcast Fallback
            S->>A: Broadcast Alert
            A-->>A: Alert Broadcasted (BROADCAST · SMS)
        end
    end
